Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:11.82,Base,,0,0,0,,Every day, we throw away countless things at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.53,Base,,0,0,0,,But where do they really go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:27.73,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the reality of waste and recycling\Nat Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:37.14,Base,,0,0,0,,Q.  Do students recycle well at our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:48.90,Base,,0,0,0,,A.  Most people do a good job, but some plastic bottles\Nare not rinsed or still have their labels on.\NI think we can do a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:01:00.11,Base,,0,0,0,,Some students throw away plastic bottles\Nwithout rinsing them or removing their labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:11.10,Base,,0,0,0,,Incorrect sorting means that recyclable materials\Nend up in landfills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:20.49,Base,,0,0,0,,But this problem is not limited to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:26.66,Base,,0,0,0,,Waste is a global problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:36.09,Base,,0,0,0,,What we do at school can make a difference\Nbeyond our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:43.56,Base,,0,0,0,,①  Empty completely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:49.10,Base,,0,0,0,,②  Rinse with water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.92,Base,,0,0,0,,③  Remove the label
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.93,Base,,0,0,0,,④  Sort it into the correct recycling bin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:12.58,Base,,0,0,0,,As global citizens, change begins with our small habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:22.48,Base,,0,0,0,,Empty, rinse, remove, and sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:33.03,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's protect our Earth together,\Nstarting from our Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:42.43,Base,,0,0,0,,SMALL ACTIONS.  BIG CHANGES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:49.83,Base,,0,0,0,,START WITH SHINJEONG MIDDLE SCHOOL
